    schema:description "Who We Are Building the AI-first frontier enterprise. We are a global technology consultancy with a trademarked, AI-first approach, Gen-e2™. It redefines how enterprises build digital products and transform their organizations with AI. We do the right thing, and we do it right. We're proud to be a World Economic Forum New Champion, and a B Corp-certified company. · We are small enough to care locally, big enough to deliver globally (10 countries, 450+ experts from 50+ nationalities) · We are becoming an agentic organization, adopting the AI-native operating model we bring to our clients. · We are robust and resilient (100% independent, 0 debt, founded 2009) · We are AI-native professionals who invest in what we believe and work as a collective intelligence · We are positive, courageous and deliver at the leading edge Your Role As a Senior AI Native Software Engineer at PALO IT, you’ll lead and accelerate the next wave of software innovation by: Crafting AI-driven architectures: Design elegant, scalable systems by harnessing AI to solve complex technical challenges tailored to each client’s needs. Elevating software craftsmanship: Write clean, maintainable code infused with AI-assistance, not just faster, but smarter and more reliable. Championing collaboration and innovation: Bring fresh ideas, test emerging AI technologies, and help evolve our Gen-e²™ methodology in close partnership with peers and clients. Navigating complexity with clarity: Transform abstract client needs into clear technical designs, visualizations, and workshops to ensure alignment and shared understanding. Ensuring quality and security: Lead AI-powered audits covering code, accessibility, performance, and security, raising the bar on what is possible in modern product delivery. Our clients include some of the world’s most successful companies. We collaborate with leading enterprises, next-generation businesses and frontier partners, shaping what comes next, helping them scale AI and solve complex business and technology challenges. You're in the right place if Significant professional experience delivering quality software across diverse tech stacks (Java, .NET, React, Angular, etc.) A technology-agnostic mindset with a passion for cross-functional collaboration and continuous learning, you are proficient yet curious enough to explore new tools and frameworks. Practical experience and a structured approach with at least one AI coding assistant (e.g., GitHub Copilot, Cursor) - you understand the power and limits of AI in real-world development. Strong grasp of prompt engineering, able to craft precise inputs that maximize AI utility. Critical thinking skills to rigorously verify AI-generated outputs, ensuring robust, trustworthy systems. A natural curiosity for emerging AI trends, always staying ahead in a fast-evolving landscape. A commitment to social, environmental, and ethical impact in technology. Tech for Good is part of your DNA. Fluency in English and a collaborative spirit ready to connect and grow within an international environment. Our consultants come from wonderfully diverse backgrounds, and we're proud of that richness. Don't hesitate to reach out even if your profile doesn't match this ad 100%. Why Join Us? 🚀 A forward-thinking, collaborative environment: Join a passionate international team pushing the boundaries of AI-native development. 📚 Continuous personal and professional growth: Benefit from our PALO IT Academy, specialized trainings, R&D projects, and knowledge-sharing culture. 🌍 Global opportunities: Experience international mobility and work alongside visionary clients and frontier tech partners. 🤝 Empowered to innovate: Shape and implement next-level AI methodologies as part of a collective intelligence. 💼 Competitive compensation and benefits: Reflecting your skills, impact, and leadership. For more on our team culture and benefits, check out our careers page. The rol is based in Paris, Hybrid model. At PALO IT, diversity is a source of innovation and impact. As a B Corp, we provide equal opportunities and assess candidates solely on their skills, potential, and motivation. We welcome applications regardless of gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, background, ethnicity, religion, disability, or any other protected attribute. Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow" ;
