    schema:description "We’re building preventive health across Europe. If you’re a doctor and Lucis resonates, write to us. What we value in doctors Solid clinical judgment Interest in prevention, not only acute care Precise, no theatre Clear thinking, clear writing Comfortable with ambiguity and building as you go Curious about how medicine works at scale French and English a strong plus No checklist of years, tools, or titles. If you practice medicine and want your expertise to reach more people, we’d like to hear from you. Paris / Europe. Full-time, part-time, or another shape — tell us what works. Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow" ;
