    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><span data-teams=\"true\">Astera Labs (NASDAQ: ALAB) provides rack-scale AI infrastructure through purpose-built connectivity solutions. By collaborating with hyperscalers and ecosystem partners, Astera Labs enables organizations to unlock the full potential of modern AI. Astera Labs’ Intelligent Connectivity Platform integrates CXL®, Ethernet, NVLink, PCIe®, and UALink™ semiconductor-based technologies with the company’s COSMOS software suite to unify diverse components into cohesive, flexible systems that deliver end-to-end scale-up, and scale-out connectivity. The company’s custom connectivity solutions business complements its standards-based portfolio, enabling customers to deploy tailored architectures to meet their unique infrastructure requirements. Discover more at <a id=\"menurhut\" class=\"fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" href=\"http://www.asteralabs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">www.asteralabs.com</a>.</span></p></div><p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">About Astera Labs</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Astera Labs (NASDAQ: ALAB) is a pioneering fabless semiconductor company headquartered in Silicon Valley, driving the evolution of AI and cloud infrastructure through purpose-built connectivity solutions. As a leader in rack-scale architecture, Astera Labs is enabling the shift to AI Infrastructure 2.0, where compute is optimized at the rack level to support next-generation workloads.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Our portfolio spans high-performance silicon, software, and system-level solutions that address critical bottlenecks in data movement across compute, memory, and networking domains. We are committed to open standards, continuous innovation, and building a collaborative environment to solve complex challenges&nbsp;at&nbsp;scale.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Role Overview</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Astera Labs is seeking a hands-on&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Senior Sourcing Specialist – Germany Operations &amp; Manufacturing</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;to support sourcing and procurement activities for our operations in Aachen, Germany. This role is responsible for supplier management, purchasing operations, commercial negotiations, and procurement support for manufacturing operations, engineering infrastructure, capital equipment, facilities, laboratories, and corporate services. The role will also provide support for materials management and logistics activities as needed to help ensure efficient operation of the Aachen site.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The ideal candidate will serve as a key sourcing partner for the Aachen site, working closely with Manufacturing, Engineering, Operations, Facilities, Finance, and Global Procurement teams to ensure the timely and cost-effective acquisition of equipment, materials, and services required to support manufacturing operations and site growth.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The ideal candidate will bring experience supporting&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">optical communications technologies</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, advanced manufacturing, engineering,&nbsp;laboratory, or other highly technical operating environments. Experience sourcing capital equipment, technical equipment, specialized services, or manufacturing-related products and services is highly desirable.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">This position requires strong sourcing and procurement fundamentals, supplier relationship management skills, attention to detail, and cross-functional collaboration. The successful candidate will help execute sourcing initiatives, support supplier relationships, negotiate pricing and commercial terms, and contribute to procurement process improvements that support Astera Labs' continued growth.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">A Day in the Life</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">In this role, you'll work closely with Manufacturing, Engineering, Facilities, Quality, Finance, and Operations teams to support a growing production and engineering environment. You will help ensure manufacturing and operational readiness by sourcing critical equipment, managing supplier relationships, obtaining quotations, supporting commercial discussions, and coordinating the procurement of materials and services needed to support day-to-day operations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Your responsibilities will range from sourcing production capital equipment and manufacturing consumables to supporting facility expansion projects, supplier performance initiatives, and logistics coordination. While the primary focus of this role is sourcing and procurement, you will also assist with materials planning, inventory tracking, and supplier delivery management to help support operational continuity as the Aachen operation continues to scale.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">This is a highly collaborative role requiring strong organization, responsiveness, customer service, and the ability to manage multiple sourcing activities across a diverse group of stakeholders.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Key Responsibilities</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support sourcing and procurement activities for Astera Labs' Aachen manufacturing and operations site.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Source and purchase production capital equipment, manufacturing consumables, laboratory equipment, facilities equipment, MRO supplies, IT equipment, and corporate services.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Execute RFQs, supplier evaluations, bid analyses, and commercial negotiations in partnership with internal stakeholders.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support supplier selection, contract administration, and purchasing activities across assigned spend categories.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Develop and maintain strong relationships with suppliers, contractors, service providers, logistics providers, and equipment vendors.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Partner with Manufacturing and Engineering teams to procure production equipment, test systems, tooling, spare parts, manufacturing consumables, laboratory equipment, technical equipment, and engineering support services.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Source specialized manufacturing equipment, laboratory equipment, automation systems, precision instrumentation, and technical services supporting production and engineering activities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support Facilities teams with site expansions, facility upgrades, equipment installations, contractor sourcing, and workplace infrastructure projects.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Assist with materials planning, inventory monitoring, and supplier delivery coordination to help ensure material availability and continuity of operations.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support logistics coordination, including inbound shipments, freight management, import/export activities, shipment tracking, and supplier delivery performance.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Manage purchase requisitions, purchase orders, delivery tracking, and invoice resolution activities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Coordinate supplier onboarding, compliance documentation, and supplier performance reviews.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"13\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Collaborate with Manufacturing, Finance, Operations, and Global Procurement teams to ensure purchasing activities&nbsp;align&nbsp;with production schedules, budgets, forecasts, and company policies.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"14\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Identify opportunities for cost savings, supplier improvements, process efficiencies, and operational enhancements.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"33\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"15\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Maintain procurement records and ensure compliance with company policies and applicable regulatory requirements.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Basic Qualifications</